# Fruit Search — Levels

## Round structure

- Default **5 finds** per round (`findsToClearDefault: 5`)  
- Each find: new random target from crowd letters on current map  
- Crowd letters shuffled into spawn slots each round  

## Maps

| id | Asset | crowdMin–Max | spriteScalePercent |
|----|-------|--------------|-------------------|
| easy | `/assets/kids/games/fruit-search/maps/map-1.png` | 6–8 | 14 |
| medium | map-2.png | 10–14 | 10 |
| hard | map-3.png | 16–22 | 7 |

Spawn coordinates: copy from work folder `data/levels.json` into `assets/js/fruit-search-data.js` or JSON under `assets/kids/games/fruit-search/data/`.

## Win condition (site)

Clear **one full round** (5 finds) on any difficulty → `KIDS_UNLOCKS.markCleared("fruit-search")` — reward code `TRACE-A-Z-4` on hub (Alphabet Trace unlock via Terminal LOGIN).

## Par

None for v1 — any completed round counts as clear.
